1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,100
The harbour was quiet at dawn.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,900
Nobody had lit the lamps yet.

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:10,100
She carried the letter across the square.

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,100
It was addressed to no one.

5
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,600
Somewhere a bell began to ring.

6
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,800
He listened, and did not move.

7
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:27,100
The ferry left without its captain.

8
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,100
Rain came in from the west.

9
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:35,600
They counted the boats twice.

10
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,900
One of them was missing.

11
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:44,100
By noon the fog had lifted again.

12
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:47,100
Then the letter was opened.

